{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":90521,\"title\":\"Love Island USA\",\"tagline\":\"Sexier. Steamier. Streamier.\",\"overview\":\"The matchmaking begins as a group of single \\\"Islanders\\\" come together in a stunning villa on a beautiful tropical island, ready to embark on a summer of dating, romance, and ultimately, relationships. Every few days the Islanders pair up and those who are not coupled are at risk of being dumped from the island. Islanders are on the lookout for romance, but the road to love doesn't always run smoothly.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kU2y21cls8WargMaX7KI47URMjD.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/m0TiLZ79RR19Zz0AZruQSBeH39x.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":7.1,\"voteCount\":185,\"year\":2019,\"genres\":[\"Reality\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":8,\"totalEpisodes\":270,\"createdBy\":[\"Brent Baker\",\"Mark Busk-Cowley\",\"Tom Gould\",\"Jo Scarratt-Jones\"],\"networks\":[\"CBS\",\"Peacock\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2026-08-31\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2301035,\"name\":\"Iain Stirling\",\"character\":\"Narrator (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hfQHOMPQ36IdjBAnEttooHO8pGD.jpg\"},{\"id\":932697,\"name\":\"Ariana Madix\",\"character\":\"Self - Host\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1bWaWfh6iN7dt5KjksalEYtZm6t.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"fpIehnHmjRY\",\"name\":\"U.S. Version Of The International Reality Sensation Love Island\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":94785,\"title\":\"Ready to Love\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/khjhqepEG8XUSkzn4FGHWbcrS5k.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.43333333333333335,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":128119,\"title\":\"EXchange\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gLPpgEwjSAJbTee886MUZlWykub.jpg\",\"rati